1
00:00:01,300 --> 00:00:03,653
Meet Apex, the Inspironics home dashboard.

2
00:00:03,803 --> 00:00:07,725
One secure front door to three platforms:
the Innovation Showcase,

3
00:00:07,875 --> 00:00:09,475
SlidesVault, and Inspironics Academia.

4
00:00:08,300 --> 00:00:10,653
Everything starts at a single sign-in.

5
00:00:10,803 --> 00:00:13,548
Users enter their email and password once.

6
00:00:13,698 --> 00:00:16,051
Apex checks them against every platform

7
00:00:16,201 --> 00:00:19,730
and opens each session, so no app asks
again.

8
00:00:30,800 --> 00:00:32,400
This is the dashboard.

9
00:00:32,550 --> 00:00:36,079
One card per platform, each probing its
application live,

10
00:00:36,229 --> 00:00:40,935
so teams can see at a glance that all
three are ready.

11
00:00:41,085 --> 00:00:44,223
Recent activity shows what changed across
the platforms,

12
00:00:44,373 --> 00:00:48,294
and quick search jumps to any project from
the keyboard.

13
00:01:02,800 --> 00:01:06,722
The Innovation Showcase is an immersive
gallery of intelligent-infrastructure
blueprints,

14
00:01:06,872 --> 00:01:11,577
command decks and architecture systems,
with an ecosystem explorer and monthly
reporting.

15
00:01:11,727 --> 00:01:16,041
Users browse and open entries right here,
in the same window.

16
00:01:40,800 --> 00:01:43,153
SlidesVault is the presentation knowledge
hub.

17
00:01:43,303 --> 00:01:47,225
Decks are synced from Dropbox through the
platform's own API,

18
00:01:47,375 --> 00:01:50,512
so the browser never talks to Dropbox
directly.

19
00:01:50,662 --> 00:01:55,368
Users search the library, open a deck to
view it, check analytics,

20
00:01:55,518 --> 00:01:57,478
and keep decks available offline.

21
00:02:15,800 --> 00:02:18,545
Inspironics Academia turns engineering
playbooks into learning.

22
00:02:18,695 --> 00:02:22,225
Learners follow courses, take tests, and
earn verifiable certificates.

23
00:02:22,375 --> 00:02:24,335
Administrators manage playbooks,
AI-assisted content,

24
00:02:24,485 --> 00:02:26,838
and integrations from the admin area.

25
00:02:45,800 --> 00:02:50,506
Back on the dashboard, one sign-in, one
address, and three working platforms.

26
00:02:50,656 --> 00:02:53,793
Apex gives every team a single front door,

27
00:02:53,943 --> 00:02:57,080
with security handled once for everything
behind it.

28
00:03:00,800 --> 00:03:02,400
Inspironics Apex.

29
00:03:02,550 --> 00:03:04,511
Three platforms, one front door.
